  "title": "Anthropic Expands Claude's AI Capabilities with New Features",
  "summary": "Anthropic has introduced new features in its Claude chatbot, including support for Opus and Sonnet, deeper app integration, and access to documents and presentations through its interface. The company also plans to expand its pricing strategies in India.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Anthropic has introduced Claude's voice mode with Opus and Sonnet support, allowing users to control the chatbot's tone.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Anthropic plans to expand pricing strategies in India, while its pricing shift aims to compete with rivals in the AI market.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Anthropic is adding the ability to create editable documents, slideshow, and access Cowork capabilities inside chat.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
